==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From the noun ''[[svar]]'' meaning "[[answer#Noun|answer]]" + the prefix [[-a]] denoting verb. Literally meaning "to [[answer#Verb|answer]]".
===Verb===
'''svara'''

# to [[answer]]

====Synonyms====
*(''to answer''): [[ansa]]/[[anza]]

====Derived terms====
*[[svara fyrir|svara fyrir [eitthvað]]] (to be responsible [for something])
*[[svara fyrir sig]] (defend oneself)
*[[svara um hæl]]
*[[svara í sömu mynt]]
*[[svara til|svara til [einhvers]]] (to [[correspond]] to [something])          

